WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:01.793
Is there...

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:02.961
...any circumstance... 

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.630
...more terrifying...

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.840
... than when a child goes missing?

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.220
It's a horrible situation.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.597
Every parent's worst nightmare.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.766
But what if I told you...

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:17.809
...another local teen went missing.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:20.854
Her name is Drea Spivey.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:21.855
Drea's disappearance...

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.650
...has never been covered by a single...

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:25.817
...news outlet.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:28.111
I aim to find them.

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.156
And the people...

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:33.242
 ...responsible for taking them away.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.079
Drea makes eleven total, all
reported  missing...

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:38.080
...in Oakland.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.708
What happened to Drea...

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.377
... could happen to any one of
your kids.

00:00:43.669 --> 00:00:47.631
I get how important independence 
is at your age, but independence in Oakland...

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:48.715
...can require a deal with the devil.

00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:51.093
The police...

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:52.094
...ain't doin' enough.

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:53.637
I'm pushing as hard as I can...

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.305
...to get more resources for Drea.

00:00:57.391 --> 00:00:58.225
While in office...

00:00:58.225 --> 00:00:59.226
 ...I championed...

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:00.519
...a strong police department.

00:01:00.519 --> 00:01:02.187
Please pardon the interruption.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:04.856
My daughter is missing too!

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:05.524
Say her name!

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:11.530
...Say her name! Say her
name! Say her name!

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:15.117
We think Drea...

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:16.326
...may have received some gifts.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.912
To my office now!

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:22.916
I don't think it's a good idea to 
be playing detective with your students.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.459
I think it might be something more.

00:01:27.296 --> 00:01:27.838
More?

00:01:28.547 --> 00:01:29.548
Like what?

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:31.717
If you think it...

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:33.593
...has a chance to bring her home...

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:34.303
...do it.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:37.639
My name is Poppy Scoville.

00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:40.475
This story...

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:41.727
...could ruin my career.

00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:43.812
It's the truth.

00:01:44.146 --> 00:01:45.188
Not a story.

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:46.148
Get in.

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:47.107
What the hell is your end game?

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.443
People show fragments...

00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:50.861
...they want the world to see.

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:52.362
I wish I could trust you.

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:53.196
Did you ever?

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:57.367
What happens when you dig deeper?

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:05.834
I hope you'll follow me into this world.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:08.337
No matter where it leads.

